"pr_53": "merged 6720c01",
"pr_59": "draft NFL-only laboratory (alpha_engine/lab). REUSABLE after review (nothing merged or copied): (1) append-only experiment ledger keyed by config hash (lab/ledger.py): our search records only the NUMBER of configurations per fold, the ledger would record every one and give the multiple-testing denominator; (2) stricter market-free guard (lab/guard.py: also rejects implied/closing/consensus and post-game columns): unify with marketfree.FORBIDDEN; (3) parametrised rating grid (lab/ratings.py) as a feature generator for the NFL tables; (4) exceedance calibration and market-comparison code for the later Kalshi step. NOT duplicated here: its NFL game/player labs and 13,362-experiment ledger. Unique to #60: cross-sport catalog, adjudication, exact series ledger, rules-text classification, raw-data collectors and readiness model, cross-sport search harness, dashboard. Both PRs reach the same NFL conclusion: independent models do not beat Kalshi prices.",
"pr_60": "this branch: single milestone PR, draft"
},
